# excludes.conf.example — Machine-specific backup excludes
# Copy this file to excludes.conf and adapt to your machine.
# excludes.conf is gitignored — never committed.
#
# Format:
#   - Lines starting with # are comments (ignored)
#   - Empty lines are ignored
#   - Lines starting with / are treated as absolute paths
#   - Other lines are treated as paths relative to $USER_HOME
#
# These are examples from a typical Ubuntu workstation — remove what doesn't apply.

# Additional cloud/remote mounts (beyond CLOUD_MOUNT_NAME from .env)
Gdrive_X
Google Drive
OneDrive

# Bulky applications / VMs
VirtualBox VMs
Android

# Terminal state (app-specific caches)
.local/state/warp-terminal

# Add your own machine-specific entries below:
